<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Keppel Marine 1H net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Keppel Marine 1H net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     7.08   vs  6.85</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	    3.80   vs  3.70</p>
<p>    Turnover			68.95   vs 62.46</p>
<p>    Other income		   3.20   vs  2.72</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     3.74   vs  4.12</p>
<p>    Interest expense	     0.03   vs  1.53</p>
<p>    Pretax			   3.62   vs  2.52</p>
<p>    Associates		     5.39   vs  5.70</p>
<p>    TAx				1.40   vs  1.20</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (0.53)  vs (0.18)</p>
<p>Note - Keppel Marine Industries Ltd, a unit of Keppel Corp, said keen competition was expected to continue in the ship repair market, but based on enquiries and jobs secured, its ship repair division could see an improvement in the second half.</p>
</text>
